  "description": "<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"316d04a3-4a76-4e9b-bbb9-280ea446c98f\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"318\">theHunter: Call of the Wild is een realistische <strong data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"115\">jachtsimulatie</strong> waarin je uitgestrekte open werelden verkent en verschillende diersoorten opspoort. De game focust op authenticiteit, geduld en precisie, met een sterk natuurgetrouwe omgeving en uitgebreide uitrusting.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"418\">Je kunt solo spelen of samen met anderen online jagen in grote natuurgebieden over de hele wereld.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"423\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"436\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"455\"><strong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"455\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"460\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"477\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"642\">\r\n<li data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"511\">\r\n<p data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"511\">🦌 Realistische jachtervaring</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"538\">\r\n<p data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"538\">🌍 Grote open werelden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"576\">\r\n<p data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"576\">🎯 Veel verschillende diersoorten</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"605\">\r\n<p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"605\">👥 Online co-op mogelijk</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"642\">\r\n<p data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"642\">🧠 Rustige en tactische gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"647\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"669\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"862\">\r\n<li data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"697\">\r\n<p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"697\">Platform: PlayStation 4</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"723\">\r\n<p data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"723\">Genre: Jachtsimulatie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"766\">\r\n<p data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"766\">Spelers: 1 speler / online multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"783\">\r\n<p data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"783\">Taal: Engels</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"814\">\r\n<p data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"814\">Uitgever: Expansive Worlds</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"836\">\r\n<p data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"836\">Editie: Standaard</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"862\">\r\n<p data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"862\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"867\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"887\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"922\">\r\n<li data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"901\">\r\n<p data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"901\">Game disc</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"922\">\r\n<p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"922\">Origineel doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"927\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"953\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"990\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"990\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-light my-2 flex gap-10 border-t pt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden h-12 w-12 rounded-lg\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-